00:58:38.490 --> 00:58:47.210
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by Mr. Torey Malatia, who is always coming up and asking me, what is the point to all these radio shows that we do?
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ对我们节目的管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚先生负责，他总是走过来问我，我们做的这些广播节目到底有什么意义？

00:58:47.210 --> 00:58:53.090
<v Jonathan Goldstein>Can you eat them? Can you build a house with them? Can you use your precious art to diaper your loins?
<v Jonathan Goldstein>你能吃它们吗？你能用它们盖房子吗？你能用你珍贵的艺术给你的腰部换尿布吗？

00:58:53.090 --> 00:58:58.460
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

00:58:58.460 --> 00:59:03.460
